Q3IcHCGkoCA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["餐點一般，主要是裡面的內場人員都沒帶手套也沒帶口罩，都在說話，摸東摸西。衛生問題極度堪憂。\n後來想說點都點了就算了，筷子是自助的放在消毒箱，拿到筷子的那瞬間食欲全無，怎麼會有這麼臭的筷子，完全就是一個大潮濕味，洗完也沒晾乾就放在裡面，重點是味道都在手上揮之不去，不用靠近聞也會飄上來，後來只能改用免洗筷。蛋的部分也沒撥乾淨卡了一堆碎小蛋殼，希望可以做好一些衛生觀念，反正我是不會再來了（而且價格也偏貴）",null,[0,201]]]],[null,1773225909000000,1773268595000000,"5 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfV2lwd3ZBbF9PUHlKMTlDdURVTWJMUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfV2lwd3ZBbF9PUHlKMTlDdURVTWJMURoSQ2dzSTg5ekh6UVlRb2FhcGVR\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjz8Lyk7NGWAxW2hq8BHUmcBa0Q_2MIaygJ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16255860950027627868/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLZWxWR1ZtNVhTRUphVW10d1JrOVlWbTVqYkdSclRqRldhRlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16255860950027627868/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLZWxWR1ZtNVhTRUphVW10d1JrOVlWbTVqYkdSclRqRldhRlJWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16255860950027627868/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLZWxWR1ZtNVhTRUphVW10d1JrOVlWbTVqYkdSclRqRldhRlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16255860950027627868/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLZWxWR1ZtNVhTRUphVW10d1JrOVlWbTVqYkdSclRqRldhRlJWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16255860950027627868/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLZWxWR1ZtNVhTRUphVW10d1JrOVlWbTVqYkdSclRqRldhRlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16255860950027627868/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLZWxWR1ZtNVhTRUphVW10d1JrOVlWbTVqYkdSclRqRldhRlJWUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["貴客妳好：餐點好吃與否是很主觀的，我想我們在園區10年的經驗來說是深受喜愛耶！對於內場拉麵未戴手套的問題，想必妳一定是第一次吃拉麵吧！不只台灣我相信在日本的拉麵店也不會有廚師帶著手套煮麵喔！但妳放心所有配料都是用夾子夾入拉麵中的。其實如果妳有疑慮當下跟店家反應我們都願意處理，筷子霉味問題，我只能說我們清洗的很乾淨，一天消毒2次，從來沒有被客人反應霉味過。至於蛋有一堆小碎殼，我也只能說不可能，我們是用糖心蛋喔！（如果妳會做糖心蛋妳就會知道不可能有蛋殼）所以沒有證據的情況下妳的說法有點出入。在最後妳們兩位進入用餐時間，也因工作忙碌一整天，不可能給員工一個不能言語的環境上班，所以交談了在請妳見諒喔！也謝謝妳的不再光臨\n",null,[0,310]]]],[null,null,311,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKelVGVm5XSEJaUmtwRk9YVm5jbGRrTjFWaFRVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb696de149b5d8bf3!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlJzUFVnWHBZRkpFOXVncldkN1VhTUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKelVGVm5XSEJaUmtwRk9YVm5jbGRrTjFWaFRVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKelVGVm5XSEJaUmtwRk9YVm5jbGRrTjFWaFRVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKelVGVm5XSEJaUmtwRk9YVm5jbGRrTjFWaFRVRRILMGRmeGFfbEFsVlcaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sSnpVRlZuV0hCWlJrcEZPWFZuY2xka04xVmhUVUUSCzBkZnhhX2xBbFZXIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR84tdmxTelrYqCzBkZnhhX2xBbFZX\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjz8Lyk7NGWAxW2hq8BHUmcBa0QoykIbCgK"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiS3MOk7NGWAxW72YsBHdZlIT4Q0pMFCCsoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjz8Lyk7NGWAxW2hq8BHUmcBa0Q0pMFCFwoAQ"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNYNEltdEh3EAE",["0x0:0xb696de149b5d8bf3",null,1728724304221527,1728724304221527,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107572858226558097119/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["美喵","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVwz6gxzrJMlPf5s5UsG5tvn7wAXiicvzygulcEVvKORSTrlh3m\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107572858226558097119?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"107572858226558097119",null,615,3684,null,[1,8,1],1,["在地嚮導 · 615 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjz8Lyk7NGWAxW2hq8BHUmcBa0Qpr8GCG4oAA"]]]],null,"1 年前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[5],null,[["CIHM0ogKEICAgICX4Imt3wE",["CIHM0ogKEICAgICX4Imt3wE",10,10,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMZfLdXL6_pRmrqyWwzFpuD1MEn_75zMKMWX4uu6XikkugIPjeUup06YJv